<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Rappel de Concert - ShowTime</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-gray-50 font-sans">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto p-6">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-sky-400 text-white rounded-t-lg p-8 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">Rappel de Concert</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-b-lg shadow-lg p-8">
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Bonjour,</p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          Nous vous rappelons votre prochain événement musical.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 rounded-lg p-6 my-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4"><%= concert_name %></h2>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
              <span><strong>Date :</strong> <%= date %></span>
            </div>
            <% if (location) { %>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
              </svg>
              <span><strong>Lieu :</strong> <%= location %></span>
            </div>
            <% } %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200 rounded-lg p-4 my-6">
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
            N'oubliez pas de préparer votre soirée ! Pensez à vérifier l'horaire et le trajet.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4"><%= message %></p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Nous vous souhaitons un excellent moment !
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Cordialement,<br />
          <strong>L'équipe ShowTime</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-8 text-gray-500 text-sm space-y-2">
        <p>© 2025 ShowTime. Tous droits réservés.</p>
        <p>Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement, merci de ne pas y répondre.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>